#
#   readable_stream_default_reader - Streams::ReadableStreamDefaultReader, its generic reader
#   mixin and ReadLoopReadRequest: reading a chunk and reading all bytes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Streams/ReadableStreamDefaultReader.cpp (lines 41-248) and
#       ReadableStreamGenericReader.cpp (lines 17-47), as part of the ReadableStream stand-in of
#       DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s). The JS-facing read() (whose results are iterator result
#       objects), the constructor from JS and read_all_bytes_deprecated (FileAPI) are phase 4.
